# .scalpelignore -- files excluded when a directory is expanded
# into the Scalpel session context.  Syntax mirrors .gitignore:
#
#   - blank lines and #-comments are skipped
#   - a pattern without a leading / matches at any depth
#   - a leading / anchors the pattern to this directory
#   - a trailing / matches directories only
#   - * matches within one path segment; ** matches across segments
#
# Examples:
# *.log
# build/
# /tmp-scratch/

